elerium, Enigma, Deep Forest, TUU, Badawi, Tuatara); la música de drones de guitarra post-shoegazing (Maeror Tri, Seefeel, Main, Amp, Third Eye Foundation) y el «ambient guitar noise» (Windy & Carl, Azusa Plane, Yume Bitsu, Surface Of Eceon). El «glitch», techno ultra-minimal hecho de errores digitales: Autechre, Oval, Alva Noto, Pan Sonic, Fennesz, Boards Of Canada, Ryoji Ikeda, Matmos. El ambient puro y el ruido (Tetsu Inoue, Thomas Köner, Aube), los tocadiscos virtuosos (Otomo Yoshihide) y la vanguardia ambient (Paul Schütze, Eliane Radigue, Hood, Vibracathedral Orchestra, Sigur Rós).","color":"#2dd4bf","family":"Vanguardia, electrónica y ambient","link":"https://volteret4.github.io/scaruffi/#ambient-glitch"}],"book_tracks":[{"id":273242258786127,"artist":"Alio Die","artist_id":21983808720390,"title":"Sit Tibi Terra Levis","year":1991,"ess":0,"yt":"I3SWolguRpE","kind":"a","book":{"id":8,"title":"A History of Rock Music 1951-2000","author":"Piero Scaruffi","url":"https://volteret4.github.io/scaruffi/"},"scene":"Ambient, drones y glitch","scene_id":223839571047121,"scene_link":"https://volteret4.github.io/scaruffi/#ambient-glitch","chapters":["Sección 6.22"],"pages":[[1,298,null]]}],"mentions":[{"book":"A History of Rock Music 1951-2000","author":"Piero Scaruffi","page":298,"text":"…Andrew Lagowski in England, Thomas Koner in Germany, Terre Thaemlitz in New York, Liquid Mind in Los Angeles, who sculpted Ambience Minimus (1994), Alio Die (1) in Italy, Stefano Musso's project, who assembled Sit Tibi Terra Levis (1991). Noise 298"}],"podcast":[],"awards":[],"concerts":[],"xref":[],"charts":[{"id":273242258786127,"type":"album","name":"Sit Tibi Terra Levis","work_year":1991,"list_id":13018320481353,"list":"Scaruffi 1990s","src":"charts","rank":393,"year":1991,"note":null,"yt":"I3SWolguRpE","scaruffi":7.0},{"id":196170620132542,"type":"album","name":"Suspended Feathers","work_year":1995,"list_id":13018320481353,"list":"Scaruffi 1990s","src":"charts","rank":392,"year":19